{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50102","headline":"游海门峡 · 无名氏","name":"游海门峡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沿流二十里，始到海门山。\n仰视见两崖，有如万盖悬。\n逐上几千仞，犹未穷绝颠。\n上有外士家，半岩得湖泉。\n湖□昏且来，意其通海焉。\n忽此见灵怪，踟蹰不能旋。\n开襟当海风，目送归海船。\n恨不到罗浮，丹溪寻列仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50102.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50102","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}